WEBVTT

00:02.213 --> 00:05.637
<i>Meeting Andy and unexpectedly
getting roped into Union operations,</i>

00:05.637 --> 00:08.475
<i>Fuko thinks twice about her own death.</i>

00:08.851 --> 00:13.318
<i>After fending off two Union attackers,
Shen and Void,</i>

00:13.318 --> 00:18.078
<i>Fuko meets Gena at Lake Baikal,
where Gena’s death and intentions deeply moves her.</i>

00:18.078 --> 00:21.292
<i>Fuko then becomes a member
of the Roundtable that assaulted her.</i>

00:21.835 --> 00:24.925
<i>This was partly done to protect herself and Andy.</i>

00:26.094 --> 00:29.225
<i>They encounter Union members
at the Roundtable room.</i>

00:29.350 --> 00:32.941
<i>The unwavering words
of their leader Juiz makes Fuko realize</i>

00:32.941 --> 00:36.949
<i>just how distant her desires
to change the organization actually are.</i>

00:37.867 --> 00:41.374
<i>Andy, in seeing his own death,
wishes to grant Fuko’s wish,</i>

00:42.042 --> 00:45.424
<i>and in order to increase likability,
the key component for the Unluck ability,</i>

00:45.424 --> 00:49.766
<i>seeks the most difficult quest
to jump higher in the ranks.</i>

00:50.267 --> 00:55.360
<i>Dragging along Shen, the man who called them into
the Roundtable, what will happen?</i>

00:55.945 --> 00:57.824
<i>The story has just begun.</i>

01:01.497 --> 01:04.003
AUGUST 23RD

01:05.965 --> 01:08.846
Wow, Andy, where are we?

01:09.096 --> 01:11.059
This is Nevada, USA.

01:12.812 --> 01:16.737
Thought about the copter,
but hitting the road feels better, yeah?

01:16.904 --> 01:17.947
Yeah!

03:13.764 --> 03:16.937
What d’ya say? How about we just book it
to Vegas for a wild time instead?

03:16.937 --> 03:24.870
W-We can’t do that! We have to head
to the place mentioned in the dossier, Lon... Lon...

03:25.037 --> 03:27.584
Um, what was it, again?

03:28.168 --> 03:30.923
Pretty sure I saw the name
at the end of this.

03:33.929 --> 03:36.852
<i>August 21st.
In New York City...</i>

03:36.852 --> 03:39.398
<i>Confirmed case of rotting corpse wandering streets.</i>

03:40.192 --> 03:45.369
<i>Conducted memory wipe of witnesses
and nearby residents pertaining to current phenomenon.</i>

03:47.582 --> 03:51.381
<i>Identity was procured from rotting corpse’s belongings.</i>

03:51.381 --> 03:53.636
<i>His name was James W. Smith...</i>

03:58.103 --> 03:59.438
from the town of...

03:59.981 --> 04:01.568
...Longing.

04:01.860 --> 04:03.572
Yup, it’s a rural area in
the western United States!

04:04.658 --> 04:07.162
They film a ton of cowboy movies there!

04:07.413 --> 04:09.375
What are you doing out there, Mr. Shen?

04:09.375 --> 04:12.632
Mr. Andy was seriously going
to leave me behind, you know!

04:14.385 --> 04:17.684
I’ve been secretly plastered out here
the whole time. I was so lonely!

04:17.976 --> 04:21.065
That’s dangerous!
Hurry up and come inside!

04:21.775 --> 04:23.529
My dear Fuko...

04:27.453 --> 04:28.914
Aah, it’s nice and cool in here!

04:37.807 --> 04:42.191
Um, so... do you think this dossier
is actually connected to Spoil?

04:42.525 --> 04:46.491
I believe so. What do you think “spoil” means
in this context?

04:48.621 --> 04:50.081
<i>Spoil.</i>

04:50.457 --> 04:53.756
<i>It essentially means to decay...
or rot away, in this case.</i>

04:54.131 --> 04:58.557
<i>I don’t know why it traveled 4,000 kilometers all
the way back to New York, but...</i>

04:59.141 --> 05:00.520
I’m sure they’ll be in Longing.

05:00.895 --> 05:04.820
By “they”... do you mean
the enemy we’re up against...

05:04.820 --> 05:05.487
Yup.

05:06.113 --> 05:09.704
<i>The UMA Spoil,
and their legion of homemade zombies.</i>

05:10.455 --> 05:13.336
Zombies, UMA Sponge...

05:13.629 --> 05:14.840
THIS IS PURELY PERSONAL OPINION
Yeah!

05:15.257 --> 05:17.427
Uh, it’s Spoil, Fuko, my dear.

05:19.140 --> 05:21.394
And it’s our job to capture that thing, right?

05:21.394 --> 05:23.607
Do we even stand a chance?

05:23.607 --> 05:25.360
RELAX, DON'T WORRY
Mao wèn tí, Mao wèn tí.

05:26.697 --> 05:30.161
You see, our investigators scoped out
the town ahead of time.

05:30.538 --> 05:34.588
They gave me audio data from when they set up
a barricade around the town’s perimeter.

05:34.838 --> 05:35.548
Care to listen?

05:35.756 --> 05:40.015
Huh? Did they all make it back in one piece?

05:42.729 --> 05:44.566
Wait, you mean they didn’t?

05:49.074 --> 05:51.788
<i>We will now commence
the investigation within the town.</i>

05:52.624 --> 05:55.295
<i>Look at that. Place is crawling with zombies.
This is terrible.</i>

05:56.548 --> 05:59.763
<i>Hey, something’s there.
Is that...?</i>

05:59.763 --> 06:00.514
HATE, DON’T DRINK!
YOU CAN’T!

06:00.598 --> 06:02.727
<i>Hey, you! Your body, it’s...</i>

06:02.810 --> 06:05.650
<i>Aah? What is this? My arm!</i>

06:05.942 --> 06:10.241
<i>Mine, too! Kill it!
It’ll stop the spread.</i>

06:12.622 --> 06:14.876
<i>Who the hell cares?</i>

06:15.126 --> 06:15.795
<i>Open fire!</i>

06:18.717 --> 06:19.970
<i>Aah, dammit!</i>

06:31.702 --> 06:34.415
Well, what do you think, Mr. Andy?

06:34.415 --> 06:35.584
Think ‘bout what?

06:35.584 --> 06:40.343
Seems you’ll have a hard time unless
you go all out... against this one.

06:42.640 --> 06:44.309
Ain’t no need.

07:05.477 --> 07:06.772
Trouble sleeping?

07:08.483 --> 07:13.409
Please rest at ease.
Mr. Andy and I will take care of Spoil.

07:16.750 --> 07:18.252
I want to help.

07:18.754 --> 07:22.845
For Ms. Gena’s sake?
Collecting points to help her cause?

07:22.929 --> 07:24.014
That’s not it.

07:24.766 --> 07:29.943
The reward that Apocalypse mentioned.
Do you remember what it was?

07:30.528 --> 07:31.988
The location of Unrepair.

07:36.957 --> 07:44.889
If we’re able to clear this quest,
and meet this Unrepair person, then maybe...

07:45.641 --> 07:50.108
...we’ll gain a clue that’ll help Andy actually die.

07:54.032 --> 07:56.078
Mr. Shen, what’s your reason for being on this quest?

07:59.042 --> 08:03.050
Oh, wait... you were forced into it. Sorry.

08:03.552 --> 08:08.896
Well, that is part of it.
But this appears to be quite the difficult quest.

08:08.896 --> 08:10.941
So I might finally be able to see him.

08:11.400 --> 08:13.906
Not the half-hearted version of him we know now...

08:15.325 --> 08:19.834
...but Victhor-god of victory.

08:28.226 --> 08:31.232
AUGUST 24TH

08:31.733 --> 08:32.818
We’re here.

08:33.069 --> 08:34.446
That our place?

08:34.446 --> 08:37.828
Yup. Beyond that barricade
is the town of Longing.

08:38.204 --> 08:39.707
We should proceed with caution.

08:39.707 --> 08:40.500
Right.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.630
Hm? Andy? What are you doing with...

08:42.838 --> 08:44.091
That wall’s in the way!

08:48.432 --> 08:49.978
- Wha...?
- Wha...?

08:58.578 --> 09:01.250
What are you doing?
We were confining them!

09:01.960 --> 09:03.087
Can they revert?

09:03.254 --> 09:03.922
Excuse me?

09:04.464 --> 09:07.053
Once they’re like that,
can they revert?

09:10.226 --> 09:15.028
No. That’s impossible.
They have already been physically altered.

09:15.403 --> 09:16.990
Oh, no...

09:17.073 --> 09:17.950
I see.

09:18.200 --> 09:20.748
Well, then!
That means I don’t gotta hold back!

09:20.789 --> 09:21.498
Wait, huh?

09:21.791 --> 09:23.461
Buckle up, kid!

09:23.629 --> 09:24.296
On it!

09:25.423 --> 09:28.346
And shut your mouth
or you’ll bite your tongue off!

09:28.555 --> 09:29.389
On it!

09:42.833 --> 09:45.129
Now, listen up...

09:46.090 --> 09:48.386
...ya bunch of rottin’ meat bags!

09:49.722 --> 09:53.187
I intend on killin’ the whole lot of ya!

09:53.855 --> 10:00.284
But if any of ya still got enough fire within
to know where the sack of crap is...

10:00.284 --> 10:03.625
...that did this to your bodies,
then ya better duck now!

10:04.167 --> 10:05.294
We gotta talk.

10:06.380 --> 10:07.591
Blood Ring...

10:15.858 --> 10:17.360
Crimson Waxing Moon!

10:17.360 --> 10:19.866
CRIMSON WAXING MOON

10:21.619 --> 10:24.207
Gee... your boyfriend sure is something!

10:24.207 --> 10:25.586
HE’S NOT MY BOYFRIEND!
Veez ghot vhy doyfen!

10:33.434 --> 10:35.396
So there is one...

10:35.939 --> 10:39.362
...who ain’t totally spoiled yet!

11:03.580 --> 11:06.210
Hey, we got one that ain’t spoiled yet!

11:06.210 --> 11:11.428
All we gotta do now
is have her lead us to Spoil, right?

11:11.680 --> 11:13.934
Ha, ha, I’ll tag along.

11:13.976 --> 11:14.644
Wait.

11:16.188 --> 11:18.527
Mr. Andy, spare a moment?

11:19.361 --> 11:22.743
Didn’t I mention that we
should proceed with caution?

11:23.537 --> 11:24.581
You did.

11:25.456 --> 11:27.043
I can move.

11:28.672 --> 11:31.803
Mr. Andy, do you have any experience fighting UMAs?

11:32.220 --> 11:33.765
Can’t say I remember.

11:34.559 --> 11:38.609
UMAs are different from us Negators.
They are the very Rules themselves.

11:38.609 --> 11:42.115
It’s common for them
to suddenly ensnare people without rhyme or reason.

11:42.407 --> 11:44.077
S-Suddenly...?

11:44.328 --> 11:45.038
Right.

11:45.623 --> 11:48.629
I’m sure you already have a hunch, but...

11:48.629 --> 11:52.344
my ability activates when I look
at my target from a certain distance.

11:55.433 --> 11:59.274
And our dear Fuko’s activates
when she makes physical contact.

12:03.491 --> 12:08.042
Knowing you, I bet you were planning
to figure out how things work here mid-combat.

12:08.585 --> 12:10.631
But that’s a bad move
when up against a UMA.

12:12.050 --> 12:13.762
It has most likely already activated its ability.

12:13.970 --> 12:15.139
Huh? Already?

12:15.641 --> 12:20.859
<i>Most UMAs will impose their Rule on anyone
who steps within their range-no exceptions!</i>

12:22.780 --> 12:25.410
My bad. Sorry, you two.

12:28.249 --> 12:30.671
Didn’t expect him to apologize so quickly.

12:33.217 --> 12:35.764
Do you feel off or abnormal in any way?

12:35.764 --> 12:36.599
Not really.

12:38.812 --> 12:39.522
Hmm?

12:40.106 --> 12:42.778
Hey, there’s something written on your stomach.

12:42.820 --> 12:43.487
Huh?

12:43.864 --> 12:44.699
My stomach?

12:44.949 --> 12:48.038
Aah, don’t rip off the buttons!

12:48.414 --> 12:49.458
<i>Now she turns away?</i>

12:54.217 --> 12:59.144
Gah ha ha ha, you’re as good as dead now!
They’ve got you right where they want you!

13:00.188 --> 13:03.235
Nothing on me...
Fuko, how about you?

13:04.112 --> 13:05.741
Nope, all clear!

13:05.741 --> 13:10.208
You must’ve went smack-dab in
the center of its target area, Mr. Andy.

13:10.374 --> 13:13.380
What do we do?
We have to hurry and-

13:14.842 --> 13:18.057
Makes sense.
Guess I’ll just wait till I spoil, then.

13:18.182 --> 13:18.892
- Wait, what?
- Wait, what?

13:18.892 --> 13:20.687
Are you sure?
You do realize you’re going to spoil, right?

13:20.687 --> 13:23.527
That’s right!
You might actually end up dead and then-

13:23.527 --> 13:24.946
Don’t be stupid.

13:26.073 --> 13:30.541
If somethin’ this small could take me out...
then you woulda killed me a long time ago.

13:43.650 --> 13:44.735
Now, let’s see.

13:49.411 --> 13:50.747
His right hand is starting to spoil!

13:51.039 --> 13:53.168
Cripes, that’s gotta smart.

13:55.464 --> 13:56.341
It’s back to normal!

13:59.347 --> 14:02.813
Oh, geez! It’s no good!
It healed, but now it’s rotting all over again!

14:05.736 --> 14:08.950
A Continuous-Effect Type...
talk about pesky.

14:09.451 --> 14:13.083
So the moment someone sets foot in this town,
Spoil curses them...

14:13.083 --> 14:16.173
...and once that person hits the curse’s time limit,
they automatically get zombified.

14:17.509 --> 14:22.978
Even if we wanted to track down Spoil,
our only lead is that communication-deficient friend.

14:25.525 --> 14:30.786
Hmm...! This quest really is difficult...
especially for three people.

14:33.708 --> 14:34.376
Wazzat?

14:37.215 --> 14:40.346
Oh, what, that’s it?
That’s your price?

14:40.847 --> 14:43.561
Hey! Looks like she knows where Spoil is!

14:48.404 --> 14:50.449
Andy, what are you doing?

14:50.701 --> 14:53.163
Right, sorry for the short notice, but...

14:53.623 --> 14:56.629
We’re gettin’ hitched!

14:57.255 --> 15:01.848
Says it’s her dream.
After the ceremony, she’ll tell us where Spoil is.

15:01.973 --> 15:02.850
What?

15:03.142 --> 15:08.068
Truth is, I dunno if it’s ‘cause I’m half-spoiled myself,
but I can understand her zombinese!

15:08.277 --> 15:09.572
Zombinese?

15:11.701 --> 15:14.039
- So, y’mind if I take the plunge?
- Huh?

15:14.497 --> 15:16.961
I’ll turn her down if you consider it cheatin’.

15:18.255 --> 15:20.761
Hold the phone!
That girl could be an assassin for all we know!

15:22.305 --> 15:24.225
You’re fine!
Take her down the aisle!

15:26.104 --> 15:28.651
Fuko, don’t encourage them!

15:32.158 --> 15:33.578
Mr. Andy!

15:34.037 --> 15:35.540
Welp, better find you a dress!

15:37.753 --> 15:39.965
Please keep this one thing in mind!

15:39.965 --> 15:42.638
This quest is for capturing the target,
not neutralizing!

15:43.765 --> 15:49.275
If you kill Spoil, then we end up failing the quest!
And we won’t get a do-over!

15:50.319 --> 15:52.991
You do want that Unrepair prize, don’t you?

15:53.117 --> 15:54.829
Oh, crap, adults!

15:55.162 --> 16:00.381
Anyway, once you learn Spoil’s location,
be sure to contact us!

16:00.799 --> 16:02.468
Hey, wait!

16:02.468 --> 16:03.847
It’s not safe!

16:14.200 --> 16:16.204
Mui, give me strength.

16:16.288 --> 16:16.956
FIGHT ON

16:16.956 --> 16:19.043
<i>Fight on, Master Shen.</i>

16:25.474 --> 16:28.480
Hold on! I’m not a zombie!

16:30.569 --> 16:34.744
<i>A kid? And he’s not zombified... but how?</i>

16:36.915 --> 16:38.375
I need to hurry and save him.

16:42.050 --> 16:44.054
Mr. Shen! What deja vu!

16:44.054 --> 16:48.062
You two make quite the pair-
you’re practically the same person.

16:48.062 --> 16:49.649
Not considering the consequences of your actions.

16:52.445 --> 16:54.992
You shouldn’t proceed any farther, you know.

16:55.368 --> 16:59.752
If this underground tunnel is also within Spoil’s range,
then that kid is already...

17:00.754 --> 17:02.131
That’s right!

17:02.925 --> 17:05.555
All of us have been cursed.

17:08.895 --> 17:12.110
Their timers have more digits... why?

17:12.569 --> 17:15.784
So, who are you people?
If you’re working for that thing, then-

17:15.784 --> 17:18.414
Hold on!
We’re on your side-

17:18.497 --> 17:19.249
Quit lying!

17:21.921 --> 17:25.428
You’re just here to kill us because
we’re doomed to be zombies!

17:25.428 --> 17:30.313
Why else would outsiders come
to a run-down town in the boonies?

17:33.235 --> 17:36.158
The fact that you haven’t moved
from that spot is proof enough.

17:38.037 --> 17:41.084
Standing there,
where the curse can’t reach you...

18:00.749 --> 18:02.418
Good grief.

18:04.674 --> 18:05.634
Aah, shoot.

18:21.164 --> 18:24.254
Hot damn, that dress fits you like a glove!

18:25.005 --> 18:28.137
Pretty sure the priest
is supposed t’say something here.

18:28.137 --> 18:34.357
Y’know, through sickness and in health-
all that jazz.

18:34.357 --> 18:38.825
But we’re both spoilin’ away
so who gives a crap, right?

18:39.492 --> 18:42.791
Th-Thank you...

18:43.208 --> 18:46.674
So long as I fit the bill,
I’ll do this as many times as you want.

18:46.674 --> 18:50.139
Hey, you lugs,
would it kill ya to show a li’l enthusiasm?

18:51.809 --> 18:56.193
Thank you... that’s enough...

18:57.988 --> 19:05.504
My dream was to wear a wedding dress...
That’s enough for me...

19:05.504 --> 19:09.385
Now, go and save them...

19:10.179 --> 19:16.149
All of them in misery, unable to die...
Please, kill them, put them to rest...

19:16.651 --> 19:20.115
And then... that... that thing...

19:20.951 --> 19:25.251
Kill that thing...

19:30.469 --> 19:36.022
Well, my orders were to capture it, but...
I can’t refuse my bride’s request, now can I?

19:38.026 --> 19:39.905
Repair boost...

19:43.203 --> 19:44.915
Crimson Cross!

19:48.923 --> 19:50.594
Why?

19:51.762 --> 19:56.062
Why won’t you spoil?
I see, a Negator?

19:56.438 --> 20:01.114
How dare a lowly Rule vessel...

20:34.389 --> 20:35.558
You dummies...

20:35.558 --> 20:37.103
Huh?

20:39.650 --> 20:46.287
...actually protected me? Appreciate it.
Guess you all haven’t spoiled just yet, eh?

20:46.454 --> 20:48.584
Oh-ho?

20:49.460 --> 20:50.170
PARTS BULLET HAMMER

20:50.212 --> 20:53.427
Parts Bullet... Hammer!

21:00.149 --> 21:03.280
Ya hear that,
all you zombified survivors out there?

21:03.280 --> 21:08.290
I’m taking on the sack
of crap that spoiled your bodies!

21:11.672 --> 21:15.722
If ya been achin’ to slug this chump,
follow the sound of the bell!

21:15.722 --> 21:17.141
But ya better make it quick!

21:50.875 --> 21:52.086
Yeah!

21:52.712 --> 21:55.008
I’ve gotta bag this sucker!

22:01.020 --> 22:06.030
TO BE CONTINUED

23:36.044 --> 23:36.545
PREVIEW

23:37.004 --> 23:40.177
<i>Once, I had a dream.
Once, I looked up to the future.</i>

23:40.636 --> 23:45.103
<i>If I didn’t know the world betrayed so easily,
would hope not have spoiled?</i>

23:45.312 --> 23:48.736
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 7-Dream.</i>

23:48.903 --> 23:50.990
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
